{"seq":2,"at":"2026-10-20","kind":"edited","target":{"type":"article","id":"a0118"},"reason":"Rewritten by the merge to take in the printed cards' questions.","by":"merge earth-space/geology","ref":"quiz-archive/runs/tp-ingest/decisions/earth-space__geology.json","changes":[{"field":"bodyEn","diff":[["=",1087],["+"," The rift can even be dived: in Þingvellir, a national park since 1930, the Silfra fissure in Lake Þingvallavatn is filled with glacial meltwater filtered for decades through porous lava, so clear and only 2 to 4 °C cold that divers in dry suits float in the gap between the North American and the Eurasian plates – Iceland is the one country where that is possible."],["=",150]]},{"field":"bodyDe","diff":[["=",1035],["+"," Man kann den Graben sogar betauchen: In Þingvellir, seit 1930 Nationalpark, ist die Silfra-Spalte im See Þingvallavatn mit Gletscherschmelzwasser gefüllt, das jahrzehntelang durch poröse Lava gefiltert wurde – so klar und nur 2 bis 4 °C kalt, dass Taucher in Trockenanzügen in der Lücke zwischen der Nordamerikanischen und der Eurasischen Platte schweben. Island ist das einzige Land, in dem das möglich ist."],["=",132]]}]},
{"seq":3,"at":"2026-10-21","kind":"corrected","target":{"type":"article","id":"a0118"},"reason":"a0118 body: \"about fifteen large plates, 30–250 km thick\" → \"seven or eight major plates, typically ~100 km thick\"; India broke from Gondwana ~140 Ma (not 200 Ma); Pacific Plate subducts beneath the Okhotsk Plate at the Japan Trench and the Philippine Sea Plate further south; Tōhoku/1933 sentences reordered (1933 was intraplate); HMS Challenger (1872) confirmed the ridge's existence, not its \"full extent\"; Iceland \"the largest\", not \"the one\", place where the ridge rises above the sea — https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Indian_Plate , https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Plate_tectonics , https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mid-Atlantic_Ridge","by":"enrich batch 038","ref":"quiz-archive/runs/tp-enrich/enrich-report/a2159-a0850.md","sources":[{"url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Indian_Plate"},{"url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Plate_tectonics"},{"url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mid-Atlantic_Ridge"}]},
